{"sheets": [{"data": [{"rowData": [{"values": [{"userEnteredValue": {"numberValue": 46210}}, {"userEnteredValue": {"formulaValue": "=HYPERLINK(\"http://jira.i-tetris.com/browse/HUR-81582\",\"HUR-81582｜洗车模式可语音关闭隐私模式\")"}}, {"userEnteredValue": {"stringValue": "现象：洗车模式开启后，语音‘关闭隐私模式’可实际关闭隐私模式。[Jira原票·描述/完整评论]\n当前实现：Alchemy HUR将原话路由至MetaId 1126，mode=privacy、op=close。[Alchemy当前·1126]\n正式资料：可读《智能情景模式功能定义V4.9》将隐私模式指向独立PRD，自动洗车模式业务流程标注待补，未定义J90A该互锁。[情景模式功能定义V4.9·隐私模式设置/13.自动洗车模式设置]"}, "textFormatRuns": [{}, {"startIndex": 32, "format": {"foregroundColor": {"red": 0.0667, "green": 0.3333, "blue": 0.8}, "underline": true, "link": {"uri": "http://jira.i-tetris.com/browse/HUR-81582"}}}, {"startIndex": 46}, {"startIndex": 105, "format": {"foregroundColor": {"red": 0.0667, "green": 0.3333, "blue": 0.8}, "underline": true, "link": {"uri": "https://alchemy.i-tetris.com/#/conversation/testing?id=27475f07-6fc5-47dc-bd3a-af07750b1683&env="}}}, {"startIndex": 119}, {"startIndex": 184, "format": {"foregroundColor": {"red": 0.0667, "green": 0.3333, "blue": 0.8}, "underline": true, "link": {"uri": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mAhtOwE67MCq4zsp9_iAkClhD34E2KdC/edit"}}}, {"startIndex": 215}]}, {"userEnteredValue": {"stringValue": "结论：定义为待复核。当前语音平台会按1126直接关闭隐私模式；可读正式情景模式文档仅将隐私模式指向独立PRD，且自动洗车模式业务流程标注待补，尚不能确认J90A是否正式要求洗车模式中保持隐私模式开启。\n依据：Jira原票及2026-07-06评论；Alchemy HUR当前1126；[情景模式功能定义V4.9]隐私模式设置/13.自动洗车模式设置。\n处理：补齐并确认J90A生效PRD中的洗车模式与隐私模式前置/互锁条款后再决定补语音需求或按现有设计关闭；J90A情景模式产品负责人处理。"}, "textFormatRuns": [{}, {"startIndex": 104, "format": {"foregroundColor": {"red": 0.0667, "green": 0.3333, "blue": 0.8}, "underline": true, "link": {"uri": "http://jira.i-tetris.com/browse/HUR-81582"}}}, {"startIndex": 123}, {"startIndex": 124, "format": {"foregroundColor": {"red": 0.0667, "green": 0.3333, "blue": 0.8}, "underline": true, "link": {"uri": "https://alchemy.i-tetris.com/#/conversation/testing?id=27475f07-6fc5-47dc-bd3a-af07750b1683&env="}}}, {"startIndex": 141}, {"startIndex": 143, "format": {"fore